Package: TranscriptMetaAnalyst
Title: Graphical Interface for Gene-Level Meta-Analysis of RNA-Seq and Microarray Studies
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R: person("Eslam", "Abdel-Salam", email = "eabdelsalam@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application and R package for the gene-level
    meta-analysis of several bulk RNA-Seq or single-colour microarray studies.
    Each study is analysed with DESeq2, edgeR, limma-voom or limma, every
    condition is compared with a reference, and the p-values of the studies are
    combined with Fisher's or the inverse-normal method. Batch effects can be
    checked and handled, microarray series can be imported from GEO, and the
    results are shown as interactive plots and tables, with functional
    enrichment (PANTHER, KEGG, STRING) and a reproducible R script. It is
    designed for biologists with little programming experience.
URL: https://github.com/Eabdelsalam/TranscriptMetaAnalyst
BugReports: https://github.com/Eabdelsalam/TranscriptMetaAnalyst/issues
